# Unblessed: new regression; first blessing awaits human review.
# Chapters 5/8/9: ordinary dispatch requires the combined first charge;
# clause 4 + const 1 cannot be paid with 4 Fuel, so it stays undecided.
# Five Fuel pays dispatch and allows before a later fault. Preemption keeps
# a deciding Verdict open; a wait seals it before follow-up work. Dropping
# leaves the new Decision undecided. Finally runs before veto sealing, and
# reaching the end of the path allows an unmatched message.
